# Hard locks

- Never write Relovi or Littleloop in product copy, UI, emails, or PDFs.
- Public copy is all-trades. Never electrician-only. Never BTS-only. The public product name is Grafter.
- Do not add modules. Deepen jobs, quotes, invoices, schedule, JHA, inspections, Take 5, and clients.
- LOOK proof is a laptop 1280 frame and a phone frame compared against the quote paper in `docs/look/`. A CSS diff is not proof.
- Route product work through poteto-mode. Prove it works on the real path before you call it done.

`AGENTS.md` at the repo root has the run, test, and look detail.
